<%= render(:partial => 'layouts/headermenu') %>

<div class="jumbotron in-ban service">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="ban-text">
			<div class="updates">Modern Front-End Development</div>
			<h1>Ruby on Rails Front End JS Development</h1>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<div id="content" class="service-wrap">
	<section class="breadcrumb-wrap">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="row">
				<nav aria-label="breadcrumb" class="brd">
					<ol class="breadcrumb">
						<li class="breadcrumb-item"><%= link_to "Home", root_path %></li>
						<li class="breadcrumb-item"><%= link_to "Services", services_index_path %></li>
						<li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Front End Development</li>
					</ol>
				</nav>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="row-am first-sec">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="main-heading wow fadeInDown animated" style="visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInDown;">
					<h1>Modern JavaScript Front-End for Rails Applications</h1>
				</div>
				<p>Build responsive, interactive, and performant user interfaces for your Rails applications with modern JavaScript frameworks. Our expert front-end developers seamlessly integrate React, Vue.js, Angular, and other modern technologies with your Rails backend, delivering exceptional user experiences that drive engagement and conversion.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="about-two-part">
				<div class="col-md-6 about-two-inner-left">
					<div class="both">
						<div class="about-left-img">
							<img src="<%= asset_path('ser1.png') %>" alt="React Development">
						</div>
						<div class="about-right-cont">
							<div class="about-title">React & Rails Integration</div>
							<p>Build dynamic single-page applications with React, leveraging Rails API backend for optimal performance and user experience.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-md-6 about-two-inner-right">
					<div class="both">
						<div class="about-left-img">
							<img src="<%= asset_path('ser2.png') %>" alt="Vue.js Development">
						</div>
						<div class="about-right-cont">
							<div class="about-title">Vue.js & Rails Applications</div>
							<p>Implement progressive Vue.js interfaces with Rails, creating lightweight, fast, and maintainable front-end solutions.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="about-two-part">
				<div class="col-md-6 about-two-inner-left">
					<div class="both">
						<div class="about-left-img">
							<img src="<%= asset_path('ser3.png') %>" alt="Hotwire & Turbo">
						</div>
						<div class="about-right-cont">
							<div class="about-title">Hotwire & Turbo Frameworks</div>
							<p>Leverage Rails-native Hotwire and Turbo for fast, modern interfaces without heavy JavaScript frameworks.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-md-6 about-two-inner-right">
					<div class="both">
						<div class="about-left-img">
							<img src="<%= asset_path('ser4.png') %>" alt="API-Driven Architecture">
						</div>
						<div class="about-right-cont">
							<div class="about-title">API-Driven Architecture</div>
							<p>Design and implement RESTful and GraphQL APIs for seamless frontend-backend communication and third-party integrations.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="about-us-second" class="service row-am">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="col-md-6 left all">
					<img src="<%= asset_path('about-img.png') %>" alt="Front-End Development">
				</div>
				<div class="col-md-6 right">
					<div class="ser-title"><i class="icofont-laptop-alt"></i>Technologies We Master</div>
					<p>Our front-end expertise spans the entire modern JavaScript ecosystem, enabling us to select the optimal technology stack for your specific needs.</p>
					<ul>
						<li>React, Next.js, and Redux for complex SPAs</li>
						<li>Vue.js, Nuxt.js, and Vuex for progressive web apps</li>
						<li>Angular for enterprise-grade applications</li>
						<li>Hotwire, Turbo, and Stimulus for Rails-native solutions</li>
						<li>TypeScript for type-safe front-end development</li>
						<li>Webpack, Vite, and modern build tools</li>
						<li>Responsive design with Tailwind CSS and Bootstrap</li>
						<li>Progressive Web Apps (PWA) implementation</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="row-am service-new">
		<div class="container ser-new-inner">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="service-single">
					<div class="ser-title"><i class="icofont-ui-browser"></i>Single Page Applications</div>
					<p>Build fast, responsive SPAs with React or Vue.js that communicate with Rails APIs, providing desktop-like experiences in the browser with seamless navigation and real-time updates.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="service-single">
					<div class="ser-title"><i class="icofont-responsive"></i>Responsive & Mobile-First</div>
					<p>Create adaptive interfaces that work flawlessly across all devices and screen sizes, ensuring optimal user experience on desktop, tablet, and mobile platforms.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="service-single">
					<div class="ser-title"><i class="icofont-accessibility"></i>Accessible & Performant</div>
					<p>Implement WCAG 2.2 AA compliant interfaces with optimized performance, fast load times, and exceptional Core Web Vitals scores for better SEO and user satisfaction.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<%= render(:partial => 'layouts/sec8interestedblock') %>
</div>

<%= render(:partial => 'layouts/footerjsblock') %>
